      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html#getDialect(org.springframework.jdbc.core.JdbcOperations)\">DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider</a></code></span>",
