      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> containing the <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a> if the <a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider</code></a> can provide a dialect\n        object, otherwise <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>.",
